IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BCROQ.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT OBL-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-OBL-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CRO-KEY
        FILE STATUS IS WS-OBL-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD OBL-FILE.
01 OBL-REC.
   COPY "BCRO".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OBL-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-OBL-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(06).
01 WS-PR-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-IN-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-FE-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-TD-ED PIC -(15)9.99.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-OP PIC X(08).
01 LS-FAC PIC X(12).
01 LS-INST PIC 9(04).
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-OP LS-FAC LS-INST LS-RC.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBL-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/crobl.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-OBL-PATH
    OPEN INPUT OBL-FILE
    IF WS-OBL-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE LS-OP
        WHEN "GET" PERFORM DO-GET
        WHEN "LIST" PERFORM DO-LIST
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "99" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE OBL-FILE
    GOBACK.

DO-GET.
    MOVE LS-FAC TO CRO-FAC-ID
    MOVE LS-INST TO CRO-INSTALLMENT
    READ OBL-FILE
    IF WS-OBL-ST = "00"
        PERFORM SHOW-OBL
    ELSE
        MOVE "23" TO LS-RC
    END-IF.

DO-LIST.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT
    MOVE LS-FAC TO CRO-FAC-ID
    MOVE 0 TO CRO-INSTALLMENT
    START OBL-FILE KEY >= CRO-KEY
        INVALID KEY MOVE "23" TO LS-RC
    END-START
    IF LS-RC = "00"
        MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
        PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
            READ OBL-FILE NEXT RECORD
                AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
                NOT AT END
                    IF CRO-FAC-ID = LS-FAC
                        ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
                        PERFORM SHOW-OBL
                    ELSE
                        MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
                    END-IF
            END-READ
        END-PERFORM
        DISPLAY "installments=" WS-COUNT
    END-IF.

SHOW-OBL.
    MOVE CRO-PRINCIPAL TO WS-PR-ED
    MOVE CRO-INTEREST TO WS-IN-ED
    MOVE CRO-FEES TO WS-FE-ED
    MOVE CRO-TOTAL-DUE TO WS-TD-ED
    DISPLAY "installment=" CRO-INSTALLMENT
    DISPLAY "due-date=" CRO-DUE-DATE
    DISPLAY "principal=" WS-PR-ED
    DISPLAY "interest=" WS-IN-ED
    DISPLAY "fees=" WS-FE-ED
    DISPLAY "total-due=" WS-TD-ED
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CRO-STATUS).
